WEBVTT

00:37:57.383 --> 00:38:02.961
not to insist on the kind of
hypersocial form of teaching

00:38:02.985 --> 00:38:08.225
of every child having to participate
in some little group of four or six

00:38:08.249 --> 00:38:09.967
or 30 other kids.

00:38:09.991 --> 00:38:11.970
How do you frame that?

00:38:11.994 --> 00:38:15.296
What's the single biggest thing
you'd love to see change at schools?

00:38:15.320 --> 00:38:19.240
SC: Well, one of the great things that I
am starting to see change at some schools

00:38:19.264 --> 00:38:25.835
is moving from a framework of grading
and encouraging class participation,

00:38:25.859 --> 00:38:28.175
to classroom engagement.

00:38:28.199 --> 00:38:31.889
And it's a subtle difference,
but it's also a profound one.